OL,3,GNEWSADrones and lasers map coast to
OL,4,Atackle erosion
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn international team of researchers is
OL,7,Fusing drones and laser technology to
OL,8,Finvestigate how natural habitats could
OL,9,Fhelp protect England's east coast from
OL,10,Fthe sea.
OL,12,FExperts from the University of East
OL,13,FLondon (UEL) and Waseda University in
OL,14,FTokyo have been surveying the Norfolk
OL,15,Fcoast at Hunstanton and Holkham.
OL,17,FUsing technology that can capture
OL,18,Fdetail accurate to 2mm, they are
OL,19,Fmapping the coast and making 3D models
OL,20,Fto understand how environments
OL,21,Fincluding forest and saltmarsh can
OL,22,Freduce wave energy.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
